Arquivo O que faz <code>main.py</code> rotas FastAPI, checagem do <code>id-account</code>, tradução de erros em 401/404/503, header <code>X-Cache</code> <code>ptax.py</code> cliente do PTAX (<code>httpx</code>), taxa cruzada e cache (bottleneck 1) <code>tests/test_exchange.py</code> 14 testes com o PTAX simulado (<code>httpx.MockTransport</code>) e relógio falso <code>bench/bench.py</code> medição de latência e chamadas ao PTAX (bottleneck 1) <code>Dockerfile</code> <code>python:3.13-slim</code> em 3 estágios: base, test (pytest + pip-audit) e final (sem root) <code>k8s/k8s.yaml</code> Deployment + Service <code>exchange:8080</code>, probes no health-check, 64–128 Mi <code>Jenkinsfile</code> Test &amp; Audit → Image Scan (Trivy) → Build &amp; Push → Deploy to EKS main.py (trecho)<pre><code>@app.get("/exchange/{source}/{target}")
def exchange(source: str, target: str, response: Response,
             id_account: str | None = Header(default=None)) -&gt; dict:
    account = require_account(id_account)          # 401 sem o header
    try:
        rate = ptax.rate(source, target)            # cache + PTAX
    except CurrencyNotFound as e:
        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=f"Currency not supported: {e}")
    except ProviderError:
        raise HTTPException(status_code=503, detail="Exchange rate provider unavailable")
    response.headers["X-Cache"] = rate.cache        # hit, miss ou stale
    return {"sell": rate.sell, "buy": rate.buy,
            "date": rate.when.strftime("%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S"), "id-account": account}
</code></pre> <p><code>Header(default=None)</code> é importante: sem o default, o FastAPI responderia 422 quando o header falta, e o contrato pede 401.</p>

Teste Garante campos e tipos <code>sell</code>/<code>buy</code> numéricos, <code>date</code> no formato certo, <code>id-account</code> igual ao header, boletim mais recente taxa cruzada <code>USD/EUR</code> e <code>BRL/USD</code> batem com as fórmulas 401 sem header ou header vazio, sem chamar o PTAX 404 <code>XYZ</code> e <code>REAL</code> 503 PTAX fora sem cache, PTAX sem boletim health-check 200 sem header e sem chamar o PTAX cache 50 requisições → 1 chamada; expira em 5 min; serve cotação antiga com o PTAX fora <p>Teste manual contra o PTAX real (18/11/2026):</p> <pre><code>GET /exchange/USD/BRL  -&gt; 200 {"sell":5.8102,"buy":5.8096,"date":"2026-11-18 13:08:44",...}  X-Cache: miss
GET /exchange/USD/EUR  -&gt; 200 {"sell":0.912091,"buy":0.911739,...}
GET /exchange/usd/jpy  -&gt; 200 {"sell":159.314505,"buy":159.254386,...}
GET /exchange/USD/XYZ  -&gt; 404
GET /exchange/USD/BRL  (sem id-account) -&gt; 401
GET /exchange/health-check -&gt; 200 {}
GET /exchange/USD/BRL  (de novo) -&gt; 200  X-Cache: hit
</code></pre>
